    {
      "id": "pensioner",
      "who": "A pensioner on the state pension",
      "fact": {
        "text": "About 850,000 people a year reach state pension age by 2030-31, up from 700,000 in 2022-23; the triple lock decides what each of them gets.",
        "sources": [
          {
            "sourceId": "obr-efo-2026-03",
            "paragraph": "4.23"
          }
        ],
        "badge": "simulated"
      },
      "touches": [
        {
          "code": "cpilock",
          "when": "on",
          "effect": "pays",
          "line": {
            "text": "The triple lock goes. My pension rises with prices only from now on, and every year the gap gets a little wider.",
            "sources": [
              {
                "sourceId": "obr-efo-2026-03",
                "paragraph": "4.23"
              }
            ],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "wpens",
          "when": "above",
          "effect": "gains",
          "line": {
            "text": "Something extra for pensioners on top of the lock. It is not often we are the ones getting more.",
            "sources": [],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "wpens",
          "when": "below",
          "effect": "pays",
          "line": {
            "text": "Pensioner benefits cut. We were told the lock was safe; this is a cut by another route.",
            "sources": [],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "rvwfp",
          "when": "on",
          "effect": "pays",
          "line": {
            "text": "The winter fuel payment is back to pension credit only. We had it back for one winter; now it is gone again.",
            "sources": [
              {
                "sourceId": "hmt-budget-2025-table-4-1",
                "table": "Table 4.1",
                "note": "line 84"
              }
            ],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "vatnrg",
          "when": "on",
          "effect": "pays",
          "line": {
            "text": "VAT on the heating at the full rate. In this house the heating is not optional.",
            "sources": [],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "itpa",
          "when": "below",
          "effect": "pays",
          "line": {
            "text": "A smaller personal allowance means more of my pension is taxed. I did not expect to be a taxpayer at this age.",
            "sources": [],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "dhsc",
          "when": "above",
          "effect": "gains",
          "line": {
            "text": "More money for the health service. At my age that is the Budget.",
            "sources": [],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "pensmth",
          "when": "on",
          "effect": "pays",
          "line": {
            "text": "The triple lock goes, for a link to average earnings. My pension will grow more slowly than it would have.",
            "sources": [
              {
                "sourceId": "rf-what-a-ratchet-2026"
              }
            ],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "dhsc",
          "when": "below",
          "effect": "pays",
          "line": {
            "text": "Less money for the health service. At my age that is the Budget, and it got smaller.",
            "sources": [
              {
                "sourceId": "hmt-sr25-del-tables"
              }
            ],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "vatelec",
          "when": "on",
          "effect": "gains",
          "line": {
            "text": "VAT stays off the electricity after March. That helps through the winter.",
            "sources": [
              {
                "sourceId": "govuk-vat-electricity-cut-2026"
              }
            ],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "vatgas",
          "when": "on",
          "effect": "gains",
          "line": {
            "text": "No VAT on the gas either. The heating can stay on a little longer.",
            "sources": [],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "mhclg",
          "when": "above",
          "effect": "gains",
          "line": {
            "text": "More for councils, which is where social care comes from. At my age, that matters.",
            "sources": [
              {
                "sourceId": "no10-social-care-speech-2026-07-29"
              }
            ],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "mhclg",
          "when": "below",
          "effect": "pays",
          "line": {
            "text": "Less for councils means less social care. That is who looks after people like me.",
            "sources": [
              {
                "sourceId": "no10-social-care-speech-2026-07-29"
              }
            ],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "vatr",
          "when": "above",
          "effect": "pays",
          "line": {
            "text": "VAT on the gas bill goes up. In winter that is the bill that matters.",
            "sources": [
              {
                "sourceId": "hmrc-vat-notice-701-19"
              }
            ],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "vatr",
          "when": "below",
          "effect": "gains",
          "line": {
            "text": "VAT on the gas bill comes down. Winter costs a bit less.",
            "sources": [
              {
                "sourceId": "hmrc-vat-notice-701-19"
              }
            ],
            "badge": "simulated"
          }
        }
      ],
      "exposure": ["broad-base", "duties", "pensioners", "councils-care", "nhs"],
      "untouched": {
        "text": "Nothing for us and nothing against us. The lock held and the winter payment held; we will take that.",
        "sources": [],
        "badge": "simulated"
      },
      "understood": {
        "text": "I could see what they were doing. I am not sure it was for people like me, but it was for something.",
        "sources": [],
        "badge": "simulated"
      },
      "puzzled": {
        "text": "A lot of talk and I still do not know what it was for.",
        "sources": [],
        "badge": "simulated"
      }
    },
